                                                "sense_id": "fe5de253-6af0-31f4-a70a-657d416405cb",
                                                "text": "... the ticking of a second hand. Tick, tick, tick. The clock. Jude wrenched himself free of his gift's trance, surprised that there wasn't a tearing sound when his hand came free of the doubloon. The visions fell away, and he felt his ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
